 "A fridge, a nurse line, a discount scheme. Just worth remembering it exists.": "Un refri, una línea de enfermería, un plan de descuentos. Vale la pena recordar que existe.",
 "You pay in {share} and they match to {share2}, so you are getting all of it.": "Tú aportas {share} y ellos igualan hasta {share2}, así que estás recibiendo todo.",
 "You pay in {share} and they match to {share2}. Every month at this level turns down {share3} of your pay that they would have added. That is a share rather than an amount, because this app does not know what you earn and is not going to ask for one figure.": "Tú aportas {share} y ellos igualan hasta {share2}. Cada mes a este nivel dejas pasar {share3} de tu sueldo que ellos habrían puesto. Es una proporción y no una cantidad, porque esta app no sabe cuánto ganas y no te va a pedir esa cifra.",
 "Nothing recorded yet. Work through the questions and put in whatever comes back, and this becomes a list of things with dates on them rather than a vague sense that there is probably something.": "Todavía no hay nada registrado. Ve contestando las preguntas y pon lo que salga, y esto se vuelve una lista de cosas con fechas en lugar de una idea vaga de que probablemente hay algo.",
 "{length} thing you have not used up will reset soon, starting with {name} in {daysUntilReset} day.": "{length} cosa que no has usado se reinicia pronto, empezando con {name} en {daysUntilReset} día.",
